---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config';
---

<PageLayout title="Privacy notice" intro="How we collect and use personal data under UK GDPR and the Data Protection Act 2018.">
  <p><em>This template is a starting point, not legal advice. Review it with your own adviser before launch.</em></p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>{SITE.publisher.name} ({SITE.publisher.address}) is the data controller for personal data collected through this website. Contact us at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>What we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Newsletter sign-ups:</strong> your email address, to send you the newsletter (lawful basis: consent).</li>
    <li><strong>Contact form:</strong> your name, email and message, to reply to you (lawful basis: legitimate interests).</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> only if you accept cookies, anonymised usage statistics (lawful basis: consent).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
  <p>Newsletter data is kept until you unsubscribe. Contact messages are kept for up to 24 months.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>You can ask to access, correct, delete or restrict the use of your data, object to processing, and withdraw consent at any time. You also have the right to complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO) at <a href="https://ico.org.uk/make-a-complaint/" rel="noopener">ico.org.uk</a>.</p>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>This website is served by a content delivery network, which may process your IP address to deliver pages securely.</p>
</PageLayout>
